reagent-name-dl-butt-growth = Glutosilin (growth)
reagent-desc-dl-butt-growth = Changes the size of the buttocks and hips by one stage per 5 units metabolized. Only affects an existing enabled part, including a hidden one. Can exceed lobby limits within available sprite sizes. Changes last for the current round.
ent-PillDLButtGrowth = glutosilin (growth) pill
    .desc = Changes the size of the buttocks and hips by one stage per 5 units metabolized. Only affects an existing enabled part, including a hidden one. Can exceed lobby limits within available sprite sizes. Changes last for the current round.
ent-PillCanisterDLButtGrowth = glutosilin (growth) pill canister
    .desc = Contains 7 pills with 5 units each.
